OL,3,AElon Musk is a 'real genius', Putin
OL,4,Asays after satellite talks with SpaceX
OL,5,Aboss
OL,6,
OL,7,FElon Musk is a "real genius", Russian
OL,8,FPresident Vladimir Putin said on
OL,9,FWednesday after revealing the two are
OL,10,Fin "close" contact about satellite
OL,11,Ftechnology.
OL,13,FThe remarks came during the
OL,14,FRussia-Africa Summit in Moscow, during
OL,15,Fwhich Putin discussed Russia's own
OL,16,Fsatellite internet project Rassvet,
OL,17,Fwhich provides internet connections to
OL,18,Fpeople from satellites.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/18
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
