OL,5,G2145 The Essay: Solo
OL,6,     FTrumpet player Matilda Lloyd
OL,7,     Fprepares to play a landmark solo
OL,8,     Fpiece in the classical repertoire:
OL,9,     FHaydn's Trumpet Concerto.
OL,10,G2200 Night Tracks
OL,11,     FSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,12,     Fadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,13,     Ffor late-night listening, from
OL,14,     Fclassical to contemporary and
OL,15,     Feverything in between.
OL,16,G2330 'Round Midnight
OL,17,     FJumoke Fashola presents another
OL,18,     Fhour of the best in jazz, and her
OL,19,     Fguest Ayanna Witter-Johnson,
OL,20,     Fchooses a third artist that she
OL,21,     Fadmires for Flowers.
